# Private venue artifacts (EXEC SPINE R-1 shape capture).
# `docs/evidence/venue/polymarket_us/` is GIT-TRACKED (135 files), and the
# smoke script's leak check (`find_secret_leak_offsets`) scans ONLY for supplied
# credential strings — it cannot see a balance or a position. Anything derived
# from an authenticated private endpoint must carry the PRIVATE_ prefix so it
# can never be added by a bare `git add docs/`.
docs/evidence/venue/**/PRIVATE_*

# AUD-02 A0: fee-drift evidence pull's raw wire-JSON captures. Outside git
# deliberately -- the evidence doc (docs/evidence/venue/polymarket_us/
# FEE_DRIFT_EVIDENCE_2026-09-25.md) records each day's sha256 manifest
# instead, and no retention job may prune this directory (Rev 2.1 item 4).
data/evidence/fee_drift/
data/evidence/discovery_set_equality/

# AUD-10b step 14: the one real promotion-proposal run's output. Derived
# from live venue/exec-state data read-only; never committed, never the
# live ~/.local/share/breezy/derived tree.
/scratch/
.venv
